1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,536
Speaking, task three. Story number 17: Visiting grandma. What did Lukáš and his mum do on Sunday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:12,233 --> 00:00:14,524
What did Lukáš and his mum do on Sunday?

3
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:37,933
On Sunday Lukáš and his mum went to see grandma.

4
00:00:38,133 --> 00:00:41,200
They went to the village by bus, the journey took an hour.

5
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:44,033
Lukáš looked out of the window at the fields and forests.

6
00:00:44,233 --> 00:00:46,233
Grandma was waiting for them in front of the house.

7
00:00:46,433 --> 00:00:49,300
When she saw them, she hugged them and was very happy.

8
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,952
Then they went to the garden.

9
00:00:51,167 --> 00:00:53,400
Grandma baked an apple pie.

10
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,355
Everyone ate it and drank tea.

11
00:00:55,567 --> 00:00:57,733
In the afternoon they picked apples from the tree.

12
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:00,384
Lukáš took home a full bag of apples.

13
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:10,340
Tell story 17 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
